cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or adapt this workshop in teaching, research or security training, please cite it as below."
title: "The Poisoned Pill — Turning Your Crewmate into a Pirate"
# Bump version and date-released with each release tag (see RELEASING.md).
version: "1.1.1"
date-released: "2026-09-28"
abstract: >-
  A 90-minute, instructor-led, hands-on workshop on RAG poisoning and
  indirect prompt injection via vector-database embeddings. Participants
  run the attack themselves against a small local model endpoint, write
  their own payload, and defeat a naive defense. This repository holds the
  workshop design (run-of-show, content outline, preflight guide, risk
  register, participant Q&A) and the Slidev deck; the runnable demo lives
  in prompt-security/RAG_Poisoning_POC.
type: software
